  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are adept at anticipating and interrupting spellcasters.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Extra Combat Talent or combat training class feature, base attack bonus +5.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may expend your martial focus to ready an attack action to disrupt a spell caster’s casting as a move action. The spellcaster must be within reach or range of your wielded weapon. A single casting attempt cannot trigger more than one readied action to interrupt from you.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may take this feat a second time. If you do, you may instead use this ability as a swift action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
